					I am a 3rd-year B.Tech student majoring in Computer Science and Engineering with a specialization in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning (CSM) at Vasireddy Venkatadri International Technological University.
				</p>
				<p>
					My primary focus centers on Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, with a keen interest in computer vision, automation, and building intelligent applications that solve real-world problems. Rather than viewing machine learning purely through abstract benchmarks, I enjoy engineering end-to-end software where intelligent systems and intuitive interfaces meet.
				</p>
				<p>
					My goal is to become a high-impact AI/ML Engineer. I continuously expand my capabilities by building practical software products, participating in technical development programs, pursuing internships, and exploring full-stack and database systems alongside modern AI workflows.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Section: Why I Built PortForge AI (Product Narrative) -->
