			<div class="mb-5 flex flex-col gap-1">
				<span class="text-caption font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-primary">
					Technical Interests
				</span>
				<h2 id="focus-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">
					Currently Exploring
				</h2>
			</div>

			<p class="mb-6 max-w-2xl text-body text-ink-subtle leading-relaxed">
				Key technical domains, engineering disciplines, and tooling ecosystems I am actively exploring and applying:
